  "solution": {
    "text": "Total Energy $=\\mathrm{Nhv}=6.022 \\times 10^{23} \\times 6.626 \\times 10^{-34} \\mathrm{~J} . \\mathrm{S} . \\times 2500 \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}=9.9 \\mathrm{erg} \\approx 10 \\mathrm{erg}$ In (A) option, it should be 10 erg instead of $1 \\mathrm{erg}$.",
